{"id":"26329ffd6ed6a5b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-comb-approachability-property.md","title":"ZFC Comb Approachability Property","display":"df-zfc-comb-approachability-property — ZFC Comb Approachability Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-approachability-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-approachability-property"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-approachability-property — ZFC Comb Approachability Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-order-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-approachability-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-approachability-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-approachability-property — ZFC Comb Approachability Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\vec a,D,C,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\vec a,D,C,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> have the signatures in the cited sources.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the small-subset carrier defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombApproachabilityProperty}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombApproachabilityProperty}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{a\\subseteq\\kappa:|a|\\in\\kappa\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{a\\subseteq\\kappa:|a|\\in\\kappa\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombApproachabilityProperty}_S(\\kappa,\\vec a)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec a,\\kappa,\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Club}(D,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in D\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\xi\\in C\\;(\\beta\\in\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma),C,\\in\\cap(C\\times C))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\;(C\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombApproachabilityProperty}_S(\\kappa,\\vec a)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec a,\\kappa,\\mathcal P_{&lt;\\kappa}(\\kappa))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Club}(D,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in D\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\xi\\in C\\;(\\beta\\in\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma),C,\\in\\cap(C\\times C))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\;(C\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The approachability witness is cofinal of order type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma)\\)</span>; it is not incorrectly required to be closed. Every initial segment must occur earlier in the fixed small-subset sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be75